### Variáveis
@host = http://localhost:8080

### Abra a documentação interativa
GET {{host}}/api-docs

### Liste as candidaturas
# Requer uma sessão autenticada. Faça login no navegador ou forneça o cookie JSESSIONID.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/applications
Accept: application/json

### Crie uma candidatura
POST {{host}}/api/v1/applications
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}

{
  "company": "Acme",
  "roleTitle": "Senior Java Engineer",
  "location": "São Paulo, Brasil",
  "jobUrl": "https://example.com/jobs/java-engineer",
  "source": "LinkedIn",
  "status": "APPLIED",
  "workModel": "HYBRID",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "salaryMin": 15000,
  "salaryMax": 20000,
  "salaryCurrency": "BRL",
  "appliedAt": "2026-07-27",
  "nextActionAt": "2026-07-29T13:00:00Z",
  "notes": "Preparar exemplos de system design."
}

### Mova uma candidatura
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/applications/{{applicationId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}
Cookie: JSESSIONID={{sessionId}}

{
  "status": "INTERVIEW"
}
